+> docker run -v "$(pwd):/code" -w /code sokrates init
+
+### Commands
+
+Run `java -jar sokrates.jar <command> -help` for the options of a command. Commands include:
+* `init`: creates a new Sokrates analysis configuration file
+* `generateReports`: generates Sokrates reports based on the analysis configuration
+* `analyzeLandscape`: creates or refreshes a landscape report (portfolio view) aggregating the repository analyses found under an analysis root. It is the landscape counterpart of the analysis commands and the same as `updateLandscape`
+* `updateLandscape`: the same as `analyzeLandscape`, kept for existing scripts
\ No newline at end of file
